    <span>Stem · Template Transformers · v1</span>
  </div>
  <h1>Built-in Transformer<br><span class="accent">Reference Sheet</span></h1>
  <p class="sub">Transformers are called inside <code>{{{{#raw}}}}{{ … }}{{{{/raw}}}}</code> tags. Only <em>default</em> is always on — the rest are enabled per render in the host. Every result below is rendered live by the engine.</p>
</div>
<div class="syntax">
  <div class="syntax-row">
    <div class="lbl">Call<b>name first</b></div>
    <code>{{{{#raw}}}}{{ transformer value }}{{{{/raw}}}}</code>
    <code>{{{{#raw}}}}{{ transformer value arg1 arg2 }}{{{{/raw}}}}</code>
  </div>
  <div class="syntax-row">
    <div class="lbl">Compose<b>| and ( )</b></div>
    <code>{{{{#raw}}}}{{ value | transformer | transformer arg }}{{{{/raw}}}}</code>
    <code>{{{{#raw}}}}{{ transformer (transformer value) }}{{{{/raw}}}}</code>
  </div>
  <p class="syntax-note">A call is <code>{{{{#raw}}}}name arg…{{{{/raw}}}}</code>. <code>|</code> pipes the value in as the next call's first argument; <code>( )</code> groups a call as an argument. The two compose: <code>{{{{#raw}}}}{{ name | trim | capitalize }}{{{{/raw}}}}</code> = <code>{{{{#raw}}}}{{ capitalize (trim name) }}{{{{/raw}}}}</code></p>
</div>